$ {{field-2}} $\\cos x$"] [:db/add "f2fadc88-9ef0-54d3-b174-74d014959c41" :question/worked-solution "Use $\\cos(u+v)=\\cos u\\cos v-\\sin u\\sin v$ with $u=x$ and $v=135^\\circ$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos(x+135^\\circ)&=\\cos x\\cos 135^\\circ-\\sin x\\sin 135^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\cos x\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)-\\sin x\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\sin x-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe first blank is $- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ and the second is $- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$."] [:db/add "f2fadc88-9ef0-54d3-b174-74d014959c41" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "f2fadc88-9ef0-54d3-b174-74d014959c41" :question/answer-fields "ac1f928b-bc39-5704-8a90-71525f3ea051"] [:db/add "f2fadc88-9ef0-54d3-b174-74d014959c41" :question/answer-fields "da9f13a9-4fe7-5249-a6f4-d840c82c6812"] [:db/ensure "f2fadc88-9ef0-54d3-b174-74d014959c41" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059821 :knowledge-point/questions "f2fadc88-9ef0-54d3-b174-74d014959c41"] [:db/add "fa6c7da7-5199-5cdc-a60f-305cb389ee4c" :answer/id #uuid "fa6c7da7-5199-5cdc-a60f-305cb389ee4c"] [:db/add "fa6c7da7-5199-5cdc-a60f-305cb389ee4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fa6c7da7-5199-5cdc-a60f-305cb389ee4c" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{2}"] [:db/ensure "fa6c7da7-5199-5cdc-a60f-305cb389ee4c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8f8c3f9b-7206-5b50-b944-86d17ecf62cf" :answer-field/id #uuid "8f8c3f9b-7206-5b50-b944-86d17ecf62cf"] [:db/add "8f8c3f9b-7206-5b50-b944-86d17ecf62cf" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "8f8c3f9b-7206-5b50-b944-86d17ecf62cf" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "8f8c3f9b-7206-5b50-b944-86d17ecf62cf" :answer-field/choices "fa6c7da7-5199-5cdc-a60f-305cb389ee4c"] [:db/add "8f8c3f9b-7206-5b50-b944-86d17ecf62cf" :answer-field/correct "fa6c7da7-5199-5cdc-a60f-305cb389ee4c"] [:db/ensure "8f8c3f9b-7206-5b50-b944-86d17ecf62cf" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "07a3523e-e443-55fb-9223-f361bf9beed2" :answer/id #uui